WEBVTT

01:41.700 --> 01:45.870
[Love of the Divine Tree]

01:46.789 --> 01:48.950
[Episode 3]

01:50.380 --> 01:52.759
[An unmanned graveyard]
[22 years ago]

02:35.870 --> 02:36.920
I have no patience.

02:37.440 --> 02:38.310
If you don't want to

02:38.310 --> 02:39.520
settle down in this grave,

02:40.000 --> 02:41.430
give me the Heart-luring Poison.

02:45.430 --> 02:46.079
Array!

03:39.500 --> 03:40.620
Who are you?

03:41.240 --> 03:42.770
How could you manipulate the Evil Fire?

03:44.000 --> 03:45.360
Where is the Heart-luring Poison I want?

03:45.800 --> 03:46.710
Us Heavenly Puppet Sect

03:46.750 --> 03:47.910
are a famous sect.

03:48.110 --> 03:49.460
We are not to be messed with.

03:49.960 --> 03:50.750
You won't tell me?

03:51.360 --> 03:52.870
I shall kill some demonic cultivators.

03:53.240 --> 03:54.680
Consider it as getting rid of the evil for the people.

03:56.060 --> 03:56.710
I'll say it.

03:57.150 --> 03:57.910
I'll say it!

04:41.159 --> 04:41.680
Guardian.

04:47.700 --> 04:49.090
Prince Zong's persuasion to surrender

04:49.120 --> 04:50.140
greatly pleased

04:50.240 --> 04:51.190
the General of Wuyi.

04:51.630 --> 04:53.310
Prince Zong's son Su Yu

04:51.680 --> 04:54.560
[Su Xiaoxiao, the illegitimate daughter of Prince Ping]

04:53.680 --> 04:55.750
will take the surrendered generals to the capital.

04:56.680 --> 04:57.950
Father asked me to deliver a message.

04:58.480 --> 05:00.530
Brother, you must bring honor

05:00.630 --> 05:01.600
for Prince Ping.

05:04.660 --> 05:05.330
Don't worry.

05:06.750 --> 05:07.600
This Heart-luring Poison

05:07.630 --> 05:08.750
can control one's heart

05:08.750 --> 05:09.680
in half an hour.

05:10.430 --> 05:11.360
It's a big show.

05:13.310 --> 05:14.560
I’m ready.

05:18.240 --> 05:18.870
I, Su Yu,

05:19.140 --> 05:19.870
greet Your Majesty.

05:22.340 --> 05:22.990
Good.

05:23.720 --> 05:24.390
This time,

05:24.430 --> 05:25.480
you managed to

05:25.480 --> 05:26.410
enlist the enemy general

05:25.780 --> 05:28.020
[Prince Ping]

05:26.630 --> 05:28.620
with your father.

05:29.830 --> 05:31.560
It's a great merit.

05:32.310 --> 05:33.430
Your Majesty is benevolent

05:33.760 --> 05:34.680
and the people are loyal to you.

05:34.990 --> 05:36.110
I dare not take credit.

05:37.310 --> 05:37.880
Your Majesty.

05:38.350 --> 05:39.590
General Li and his deputy general

05:39.870 --> 05:41.120
are waiting outside the camp.

05:41.800 --> 05:42.430
Send him in!

05:42.800 --> 05:45.040
General Li is here!

05:49.450 --> 05:50.570
I, Li Hu, who have sinned,

05:50.600 --> 05:51.630
greet your majesty.

05:52.070 --> 05:54.040
I'm willing to present the frontier defense map

05:54.159 --> 05:55.270
to Your Majesty.

05:55.920 --> 05:58.000
Thank you, Your Majesty.

06:37.159 --> 06:37.860
Leave him alive.

06:50.190 --> 06:51.510
Your Majesty, are you alright?

06:52.190 --> 06:53.020
I'm fine.

06:54.480 --> 06:55.600
I was negligent.

06:56.000 --> 06:57.600
I didn't know that this surrender was a fraud.

06:58.360 --> 06:59.360
Please punish me, Your Majesty.

07:04.720 --> 07:05.560
Prince Ping.

07:06.040 --> 07:06.750
Yes, Your Majesty.

07:07.560 --> 07:08.560
Thanks to your son,

07:08.560 --> 07:10.040
can I be

07:10.140 --> 07:12.340
safe right now.

07:12.930 --> 07:14.450
Your Majesty is blessed

07:14.480 --> 07:15.800
by the Dragon and Heaven,

07:16.230 --> 07:16.800
Reward him!

07:17.360 --> 07:18.120
Thank you, Your Majesty.

07:18.680 --> 07:20.190
Thank you, Your Majesty.

07:30.950 --> 07:32.830
I was waiting for the legitimate son to be rewarded.

07:33.159 --> 07:35.070
Who knew this would happen?

07:35.310 --> 07:36.040
Exactly.

07:41.560 --> 07:44.120
He's just an illegitimate son.

07:44.610 --> 07:45.290
How dare he

07:46.000 --> 07:47.870
ask for rewards right in front

07:47.870 --> 07:49.390
of His Majesty?

07:52.159 --> 07:53.720
You don't know yet, do you?

07:54.430 --> 07:56.230
This guy from Prince Ping's residence

07:56.870 --> 07:59.070
comes from quite the background.

07:59.630 --> 08:00.510
His mother

08:00.830 --> 08:03.450
was the most popular escort

08:03.480 --> 08:04.920
in the capital.

08:06.120 --> 08:07.240
But,

08:07.570 --> 08:09.890
since Prince Ping already has a son,

08:10.070 --> 08:11.600
why did he bring this filthy son

08:11.600 --> 08:12.390
back?

08:12.560 --> 08:13.330
I don't know.

08:13.360 --> 08:13.920
No idea.

08:14.070 --> 08:14.720
Because...

08:14.830 --> 08:16.360
Prince Ping has read his fortune.

08:16.720 --> 08:17.800
He said that this filthy son

08:17.830 --> 08:19.070
is good for him.

08:21.000 --> 08:22.070
After all,

08:22.070 --> 08:24.160
his mother had slept with many people.

08:24.460 --> 08:25.460
Many people are thankful towards her.

08:25.830 --> 08:27.830
It's also a powerful force.

08:27.830 --> 08:28.620
Right?

08:41.600 --> 08:42.150
Qingge.

08:47.790 --> 08:48.440
Wait.

08:51.960 --> 08:52.840
Get up.

08:56.520 --> 08:57.830
You're quite beautiful.

08:58.250 --> 08:59.820
But one move of yours could take his life.

09:00.040 --> 09:01.370
That's cruel.

09:01.510 --> 09:02.390
You can't do that.

09:21.750 --> 09:22.630
Brother.

09:25.000 --> 09:26.030
Are you okay?

09:31.620 --> 09:33.820
Marquis, you owe me your life.

09:34.120 --> 09:35.440
Pay me back with money.

09:36.320 --> 09:37.030
10,000 taels

09:37.720 --> 09:38.390
of gold.

09:40.440 --> 09:41.530
The girl in red

09:41.560 --> 09:42.600
is Mu Qingge.

09:42.980 --> 09:43.690
It’s said

09:43.720 --> 09:45.030
she's only 25 years old,

09:45.360 --> 09:46.520
but she's already an amazing

09:46.550 --> 09:47.510
immortal master.

09:48.150 --> 09:48.840
However,

09:49.200 --> 09:49.870
she disobeyed

09:49.870 --> 09:51.120
the rules of the Four Mystery Sect

09:51.680 --> 09:52.520
and betrayed them,

09:52.550 --> 09:53.630
living recklessly.

09:54.150 --> 09:55.910
All of the Heavenly Sects have regarded her as evil.

09:56.950 --> 09:57.670
Somehow,

09:57.790 --> 09:59.390
she got involved with Su Yu.

10:00.150 --> 10:01.320
I’m afraid it’s a trouble.

10:02.390 --> 10:03.510
Go and get punished.

10:16.270 --> 10:17.120
So what?

10:17.650 --> 10:18.630
No one can stop me

10:18.630 --> 10:19.440
from accomplishing a great cause.

10:26.420 --> 10:29.060
[Imperial City, Prince Zong's residence]

10:29.170 --> 10:30.220
Will the royal family

10:30.240 --> 10:31.910
be implicated given what happened today??

10:32.390 --> 10:33.280
His Majesty is wise.

10:33.630 --> 10:34.930
His Majesty won't believe that

10:34.960 --> 10:36.390
those enemies have something to do with my father and I.

10:37.270 --> 10:37.720
By the way,

10:38.320 --> 10:39.320
the people from Marquis Yong'an's residence

10:39.440 --> 10:40.440
in the military camp right now

10:40.440 --> 10:41.960
have always been dissatisfied with Prince Ping.

10:42.720 --> 10:43.960
They were rude.

10:44.360 --> 10:45.310
Don't take it to heart.

10:47.550 --> 10:49.280
I don't care what your minions do.

10:49.970 --> 10:51.210
I'm still worried about

10:51.390 --> 10:52.550
my trip down the mountain this time

10:52.550 --> 10:53.480
to take in apprentices.

10:55.600 --> 10:56.300
Sister!

10:58.060 --> 10:58.880
Sister!

10:58.910 --> 10:59.520
Wu.

11:01.500 --> 11:02.690
The legitimate son told me as soon as he came back

11:02.720 --> 11:03.670
that you would come today too.

11:03.870 --> 11:05.090
I asked my servants

11:05.120 --> 11:06.870
to prepare many tea snacks for you.

11:07.720 --> 11:08.270
Wu.

11:08.570 --> 11:09.450
During this time,

11:09.480 --> 11:10.670
you've been by Yu's side.

11:10.910 --> 11:12.080
Did you cause him any trouble?

11:13.320 --> 11:14.440
I've always treated Wu as my sister.

11:15.200 --> 11:15.910
How could there be any trouble?

11:17.150 --> 11:17.670
Let's go.

11:21.750 --> 11:24.030
[Imperial City, Prince Ping's residence]

11:27.150 --> 11:28.870
The Crown Prince has been dead for many years.

11:29.960 --> 11:30.870
His Majesty

11:31.510 --> 11:33.800
has yet to selected the Crown Prince

11:33.820 --> 11:35.100
between me and Prince Zong.

11:35.960 --> 11:37.270
Although what happened today

11:37.790 --> 11:38.980
didn't help him gain power

11:39.010 --> 11:40.700
on defending the southwest,

11:42.270 --> 11:43.720
Prince Zong's

11:43.720 --> 11:45.030
power in the court

11:45.670 --> 11:46.910
is still formidable.

11:47.550 --> 11:48.080
So,

11:49.110 --> 11:50.710
we need to hurry up with our plan.

11:51.360 --> 11:54.150
[Magician]

11:51.840 --> 11:53.750
I've already figured out that

11:54.270 --> 11:55.480
Young Master Su Yishui

11:55.870 --> 11:57.600
has a rare

11:57.600 --> 11:58.630
Yin body.

11:59.210 --> 12:01.090
That can help His Majesty complete his great cause.

12:01.750 --> 12:03.700
So, His Majesty took him back to his mansion.

12:04.670 --> 12:06.240
Eight years have passed.

12:06.750 --> 12:07.830
What was put

12:07.850 --> 12:08.890
in his body earlier

12:09.150 --> 12:09.870
has now

12:09.870 --> 12:11.270
taken its initial form.

12:12.180 --> 12:13.350
Soon,

12:13.910 --> 12:15.200
you can combine

12:15.750 --> 12:16.870
these two bodies into one.

12:18.720 --> 12:19.240
Good.

12:20.550 --> 12:21.790
I've been waiting for this day

12:21.790 --> 12:23.080
for a long time.

12:26.250 --> 12:28.640
[Young Su Yishui]

12:49.670 --> 12:50.150
Father.

12:53.960 --> 12:54.550
Your Highness.

12:56.480 --> 12:57.630
Please take me in.

13:03.350 --> 13:04.200
First,

13:05.010 --> 13:06.170
you need to know

13:07.080 --> 13:08.480
I don't need a son.

13:09.060 --> 13:11.300
I need someone valuable.

13:13.720 --> 13:14.910
If you can do it,

13:15.690 --> 13:17.360
I can keep you here

13:17.460 --> 13:18.120
and

13:18.670 --> 13:20.080
give you a status.

13:23.080 --> 13:23.510
I...

13:24.890 --> 13:26.360
I will become

13:26.360 --> 13:27.360
a valuable person.

13:34.630 --> 13:36.030
This contains the ultimate power

13:36.030 --> 13:37.480
in this world

13:38.510 --> 13:39.440
called Spirit Spring.

13:40.840 --> 13:42.360
As long as you have it,

13:42.590 --> 13:43.870
it's easy to

13:44.030 --> 13:45.150
control the world.

13:46.200 --> 13:46.960
Unfortunately,

13:47.200 --> 13:48.080
this is the only drop

13:48.080 --> 13:49.630
I have by chance.

13:50.550 --> 13:52.510
The Spirit Spring is now sealed in the netherworld.

13:52.840 --> 13:53.630
Only the Demon's child

13:53.910 --> 13:55.080
can summon it.

13:55.870 --> 13:56.550
The yin body

13:56.550 --> 13:58.080
is a natural Spirit Spring container.

13:58.100 --> 13:58.670
And you

13:58.870 --> 13:59.480
are the one in a million

13:59.510 --> 14:01.550
candidate to be Demon's child.

14:02.210 --> 14:03.680
After refining,

14:04.440 --> 14:06.030
you can integrate into one

14:06.920 --> 14:08.760
with this Spirit Spring.

14:16.360 --> 14:17.670
I have put this Spirit Spring

14:17.690 --> 14:18.810
into your heart

14:19.160 --> 14:21.530
and sacrifice your body to the Spirit Spring.

14:22.240 --> 14:22.870
And you

14:23.510 --> 14:24.720
will eventually find the Spirit Spring

14:24.720 --> 14:26.320
for His Majesty.

14:45.870 --> 14:47.320
That talisman just now

14:47.720 --> 14:50.150
can keep you alive in this barrier.

14:50.480 --> 14:51.510
Only by killing

14:51.510 --> 14:52.410
the demon beast inside

14:52.440 --> 14:53.550
can get out.

14:53.790 --> 14:54.480
Otherwise,

14:55.150 --> 14:56.120
that demon beast

14:56.120 --> 14:58.040
will keep attacking you.

14:58.620 --> 14:59.190
All right.

14:59.960 --> 15:01.840
Refine yourself in there.

15:11.920 --> 15:12.640
Xiaoxiao.

15:13.320 --> 15:13.910
Remember,

15:14.410 --> 15:16.290
send him food every three days.

15:16.920 --> 15:17.750
Keep an eye on this place.

15:16.990 --> 15:18.920
[Young Su Xiaoxiao]

15:18.320 --> 15:19.240
If anything happens,

15:19.510 --> 15:21.080
tell Father.

15:21.600 --> 15:22.720
Yes, Father.

15:23.550 --> 15:24.150
Good girl.

16:01.080 --> 16:02.540
[One year later]

16:18.120 --> 16:19.360
Brother!

16:21.110 --> 16:22.680
Brother, wake up!

16:22.910 --> 16:24.390
Brother, wake up!

16:31.000 --> 16:32.080
You're from a lowly family.

16:32.160 --> 16:33.710
You don't deserve to study in the Imperial Academy with us.

16:33.740 --> 16:34.860
Get lost!

16:35.360 --> 16:36.120
Shoo!

16:41.620 --> 16:42.270
Are you okay?

16:43.380 --> 16:44.550
-Are you okay?
-Brother.

16:44.890 --> 16:46.890
Why are they always doing this to us?

16:48.270 --> 16:49.630
Has anyone ever

16:49.630 --> 16:50.550
cared about us?

16:52.660 --> 16:53.540
One day,

16:54.670 --> 16:55.790
when we are useless to

16:55.790 --> 16:56.600
to Prince Ping's residence,

16:57.910 --> 16:59.480
we won't even be

16:59.480 --> 17:00.240
in this situation anymore.

17:04.680 --> 17:05.480
So...

17:06.589 --> 17:07.910
we can only climb up the ladder

17:09.040 --> 17:10.329
on our own.

17:15.140 --> 17:16.250
When others are cruel to you,

17:16.440 --> 17:17.880
only by becoming stronger

17:19.079 --> 17:19.720
can you

17:20.240 --> 17:22.280
become the final winner.

17:33.880 --> 17:34.550
Today,

17:36.070 --> 17:37.350
I can endure everything.

17:38.240 --> 17:39.070
In the future,

17:39.640 --> 17:41.240
I'll have everyone who's done us wrong

17:41.480 --> 17:42.600
and looked down on us

17:42.690 --> 17:43.760
pay the price.

18:13.200 --> 18:14.500
I feel the Spirit Spring.

18:22.110 --> 18:22.680
Young Master has

18:22.680 --> 18:24.680
finally connected with the Spirit Spring.

18:25.230 --> 18:25.840
However,

18:26.000 --> 18:27.240
to retrieve the Spirit Spring

18:27.240 --> 18:28.160
in the netherworld,

18:28.260 --> 18:29.680
you must learn

18:29.700 --> 18:30.770
the Demon Heart Primordial Absorption Technique quickly.

18:32.350 --> 18:33.510
The Demon Heart Primordial Absorption Technique?

18:34.160 --> 18:34.720
That's right.

18:35.550 --> 18:36.640
This technique

18:36.660 --> 18:38.450
can absorb the power of others

18:38.660 --> 18:39.710
and the spiritual power of everything.

18:41.120 --> 18:42.880
You need to learn this skill

18:43.180 --> 18:45.590
to finally summon the Spirit Spring.

18:46.390 --> 18:47.460
Unfortunately,

18:47.640 --> 18:48.560
this technique

18:48.720 --> 18:50.440
has been sealed off by the Eternal Sect.

18:50.960 --> 18:52.030
That's no problem.

18:52.310 --> 18:53.750
They're just a cultivation sect.

18:54.000 --> 18:55.400
I'll send troops to annihilate them.

18:56.400 --> 18:57.110
Father, you can't.

18:57.510 --> 18:58.270
If we rob them,

18:58.290 --> 18:59.530
we might alert them

18:59.750 --> 19:00.960
and draw Prince Zong's attention.

19:01.750 --> 19:03.070
Why don't you leave this to me?

19:03.590 --> 19:04.480
I have a way to get it.

19:07.690 --> 19:09.930
[Eternal Sect’s gate]

19:15.000 --> 19:16.350
The Heavenly Sects don't involve themselves in worldly matters.

19:16.960 --> 19:18.270
Especially when it involves the royal power.

19:18.930 --> 19:20.280
I'm going to join the sect as a disciple

19:20.720 --> 19:22.160
and take the chance to get the Demon Heart Primordial Absorption Technique.

19:22.750 --> 19:24.200
I need to hide my real identity.

19:25.680 --> 19:27.350
Why do you have to have to get this Demon Heart

19:27.350 --> 19:28.590
Primordial Absorption Technique yourself?

19:29.830 --> 19:31.070
It doesn't matter if I

19:31.110 --> 19:32.000
do it myself.

19:32.350 --> 19:33.240
What matters is

19:34.200 --> 19:35.350
I want to join the Eternal Sect.

19:35.470 --> 19:36.580
[Eternal Sect]

19:37.680 --> 19:39.110
If I obey them and cultivate

19:39.880 --> 19:41.270
the Demon Heart Primordial Absorption Technique

19:41.270 --> 19:42.110
to integrate the Spirit Spring,

19:42.720 --> 19:44.520
I will eventually be swallowed by the Spirit Spring.

19:45.590 --> 19:46.510
If I master

19:46.510 --> 19:47.640
the supreme technique of a Heavenly Sect,

19:48.110 --> 19:48.720
my body will have the spiritual power

19:48.720 --> 19:50.070
to fight the Spirit Spring.

19:50.960 --> 19:52.160
Even if I practice demonic magic,

19:52.450 --> 19:53.860
there's room for me to fight.

19:54.590 --> 19:55.510
What I've always wanted is to

19:55.510 --> 19:56.590
control the Spirit Spring myself.

19:57.050 --> 19:57.680
Not to be a tool

19:57.680 --> 19:58.680
to be manipulated by others.

20:01.350 --> 20:02.070
All these years,

20:02.410 --> 20:03.790
I finally have two trusted subordinates,

20:03.790 --> 20:04.480
Yu Tong and Yu Chen.

20:05.080 --> 20:05.800
They are no longer people

20:05.830 --> 20:07.310
sent by Father to spy on me.

20:07.880 --> 20:09.030
If you need anything,

20:09.710 --> 20:11.030
just go to them.

20:37.640 --> 20:38.160
Father.

20:44.960 --> 20:46.440
You did well today.

20:47.010 --> 20:48.140
I'm very satisfied.

20:48.940 --> 20:49.820
Thank you, Father.

20:50.640 --> 20:52.720
I've sent you to the Eternal Sect for days.

20:53.200 --> 20:55.590
Have you found the Demon Heart Primordial Absorption Technique?

20:56.200 --> 20:57.190
The Demon Heart Primordial Absorption Technique

20:57.440 --> 20:58.790
is sealed in their library.

20:59.240 --> 21:00.510
One can only get in with the soverign's

21:00.510 --> 21:01.270
spiritual power.

21:01.830 --> 21:02.760
I've just been promoted from an external disciple

21:02.790 --> 21:03.440
to an internal one.

21:03.690 --> 21:04.640
I haven't gotten the chance yet.

21:07.270 --> 21:08.640
Hurry up.

21:09.240 --> 21:10.440
Time is running out.

21:11.070 --> 21:11.590
Yes.

21:12.550 --> 21:13.200
Also,

21:14.000 --> 21:15.270
I have another thing

21:15.270 --> 21:16.230
you need to do.

21:32.830 --> 21:33.790
What's going on?

21:40.580 --> 21:41.340
Mu.

21:40.730 --> 21:43.650
[Alcohol Immortal]

21:41.790 --> 21:43.790
This is a sign of ascension.

21:44.110 --> 21:45.480
Our divination told us that,

21:45.640 --> 21:47.160
so we're here to celebrate with you.

21:47.440 --> 21:48.070
Ascension?

21:48.410 --> 21:49.280
Rumour has it that

21:49.310 --> 21:50.550
the Demon's child that can control the netherworld's Spirit Spring

21:50.280 --> 21:53.010
[Liang Wumeng]

21:50.590 --> 21:51.720
is about to appear.

21:52.400 --> 21:53.880
You have attained great cultivation.

21:54.030 --> 21:54.890
You're only one step away

21:54.920 --> 21:56.350
from becoming an immortal.

21:56.580 --> 21:58.490
If we can kill the Demon's child to prove your loyalty,

21:59.550 --> 22:00.160
I think

22:00.350 --> 22:01.040
it must be a good opportunity for you

22:01.070 --> 22:02.750
to ascend successfully.

22:03.350 --> 22:04.310
Congratulations.

22:05.830 --> 22:06.790
For what?

22:09.350 --> 22:11.350
That you have such a situation at such a young age.

22:11.790 --> 22:13.270
What's the use of being an immortal?

22:13.870 --> 22:15.570
Everyone says cultivating to become an immortal

22:15.600 --> 22:16.880
is to save the world.

22:17.400 --> 22:18.530
But after becoming an immortal,

22:19.030 --> 22:21.200
the immortals would pray that the four realms are but nothing

22:21.240 --> 22:22.240
and that don't care about the world.

22:22.930 --> 22:23.960
As a human,

22:24.400 --> 22:26.190
I'm obsessed with the secular world.

22:27.000 --> 22:28.750
I've gained so much in the mortal world.

22:29.240 --> 22:30.380
If I get it from the heaven and the earth,

22:30.440 --> 22:31.510
I return it to heaven and earth.

22:31.990 --> 22:33.300
That's the way in my heart.

22:35.200 --> 22:36.000
With your temper,

22:36.230 --> 22:38.120
you just want to go against what ordinary people do.

22:38.640 --> 22:40.070
No wonder those righteous sects

22:40.190 --> 22:41.470
think of you as a demoness.

22:42.790 --> 22:43.680
Whatever.

22:45.270 --> 22:46.000
But

22:46.120 --> 22:47.000
it seems that

22:47.030 --> 22:48.070
I have to restrain myself.

22:48.500 --> 22:49.830
I haven’t found a disciple for

22:49.830 --> 22:50.720
my Five Spirit Roots.

22:50.960 --> 22:52.070
If I ascend carelessly,

22:52.200 --> 22:53.070
it’ll be troublesome.

22:54.710 --> 22:55.510
Five Spirit Roots?

22:56.110 --> 22:57.550
Over these thousands of years,

22:57.570 --> 22:58.750
how many Five Spirit Roots are there

22:58.750 --> 23:00.270
like you?

23:00.660 --> 23:02.070
You want to take in a disciple??

23:02.230 --> 23:03.170
Why don't you go and see

23:03.200 --> 23:05.070
if the Jingwei bird has finished filling the sea.

23:06.380 --> 23:07.860
One needs to have a dream.

23:08.240 --> 23:08.960
Otherwise,

23:08.960 --> 23:10.030
with only one Five Spirit Roots, which is me, in the world

23:10.290 --> 23:11.010
it'd be so boring.

23:12.350 --> 23:12.920
Fine.

23:13.400 --> 23:14.480
In that case,

23:16.360 --> 23:18.030
I'll give you this Yin Eye Stone

23:18.200 --> 23:19.070
from netherworld.

23:19.520 --> 23:21.130
If it meets the Spirit Spring or the Demon's child,

23:21.460 --> 23:22.590
it will sense it.

23:24.590 --> 23:25.240
Good stuff.

23:25.720 --> 23:26.310
Thanks.

23:27.900 --> 23:29.610
Just in case you ascend

23:29.640 --> 23:30.640
before you can get a disciple.

23:32.310 --> 23:33.110
But

23:33.880 --> 23:35.200
if the Demon's child appears,

23:35.540 --> 23:36.060
the world

23:36.450 --> 23:37.420
will be in chaos.

23:38.000 --> 23:38.640
By then,

23:38.920 --> 23:40.320
will you

23:40.440 --> 23:41.790
care or not?

23:43.160 --> 23:44.990
I live by the day.

23:45.370 --> 23:46.810
Let's talk about it

23:47.070 --> 23:47.550
when it happens.

23:48.610 --> 23:49.310
Mu.

23:50.290 --> 23:51.900
We gave you something good.

23:52.220 --> 23:53.080
You're not going to treat us

23:53.110 --> 23:54.550
to few jars of Mistaken Divine before you leave?

23:55.310 --> 23:56.440
I've someone to meet.

23:56.590 --> 23:57.720
I'll buy you a drink next time.

23:58.830 --> 23:59.510
Hey!

23:59.660 --> 24:00.100
You've changed!

24:02.810 --> 24:03.880
Second Young Master is missing?

24:04.030 --> 24:04.440
Yes.

24:04.720 --> 24:06.070
A few days ago, on his way to the Imperial Academy,

24:06.160 --> 24:07.270
he was ambushed.

24:07.410 --> 24:08.880
All the guards were killed

24:09.030 --> 24:09.880
and he was abducted.

24:10.110 --> 24:11.550
Did you find out who did it?

24:11.880 --> 24:13.070
It must be Prince Ping's men.

24:13.270 --> 24:14.310
Prince Ping has always been afraid of

24:14.310 --> 24:14.960
Second Brother's uncle's

24:14.960 --> 24:16.680
military power in the Northern General's hands.

24:16.830 --> 24:17.720
A few years ago,

24:18.310 --> 24:19.640
my second brother's mother passed away.

24:20.270 --> 24:21.000
If it weren't for

24:21.000 --> 24:21.880
my brother's bloodline,

24:22.730 --> 24:23.760
the Northern General wouldn't

24:23.790 --> 24:24.510
support my father

24:24.510 --> 24:25.440
like he is right now.

24:27.110 --> 24:28.350
Even the children can't escape

24:28.820 --> 24:30.730
the royal power struggle.

24:31.710 --> 24:32.450
Qingge.

24:33.180 --> 24:34.900
I’ve sent people to search everywhere.

24:35.200 --> 24:36.070
But there hasn't been

24:36.310 --> 24:37.310
any news for days.

24:38.070 --> 24:38.920
I'm worried

24:38.920 --> 24:39.720
for his safety.

24:41.270 --> 24:42.350
You want me to help you?

24:47.940 --> 24:48.500
Qingge.

24:49.310 --> 24:50.070
I know those of the Heavenly Sects

24:50.100 --> 24:51.340
can't interfere with royal affairs.

24:52.550 --> 24:53.110
But...

24:54.420 --> 24:55.460
But I really can't

24:55.490 --> 24:56.730
ignore my brother's life.

24:58.310 --> 24:59.960
You once said you would repay me.

25:00.550 --> 25:02.000
I shouldn't threaten you.

25:02.640 --> 25:03.480
But this time,

25:03.900 --> 25:05.130
can I use this favor

25:05.160 --> 25:05.720
in exchange?

25:08.350 --> 25:09.550
Please save my second brother.

25:10.240 --> 25:11.110
When my sister

25:11.750 --> 25:13.130
and I were escaping from the famine when we were young,

25:13.480 --> 25:14.960
you once helped us by giving us food.

25:15.880 --> 25:17.640
Are you really going to use this favor

25:17.660 --> 25:18.570
to save your brother?

25:19.640 --> 25:20.880
He is my brother.

25:21.240 --> 25:22.090
Nothing is more important

25:22.110 --> 25:23.380
than his safety.

25:25.110 --> 25:25.590
Okay.

25:26.260 --> 25:27.000
I promise you.

25:27.680 --> 25:28.760
I will return your brother

25:28.920 --> 25:30.200
to you safely.

25:38.790 --> 25:40.350
He was kidnapped here.

25:45.910 --> 25:46.790
A hidden talisman?

25:47.540 --> 25:48.680
That's a Eternal Sect technique.

25:49.560 --> 25:50.970
They didn’t kill him on the spot

25:51.000 --> 25:51.920
but abducted him.

25:52.480 --> 25:54.110
That means he should be fine now.

26:20.880 --> 26:22.030
Young Master,

26:22.310 --> 26:23.720
it's fate that

26:23.720 --> 26:24.540
we meet here by fate.

26:25.030 --> 26:25.880
Have a drink on me.

26:28.270 --> 26:29.270
I am Mu Qingge

26:29.610 --> 26:30.410
from Wester Sect.

26:38.990 --> 26:40.880
Don’t turn me down.

26:41.270 --> 26:42.960
You're pretty handsome.

26:43.310 --> 26:45.050
Quite up my alley.

26:45.350 --> 26:46.960
Would you like to come back to Mount Wester with me?

26:56.980 --> 26:58.100
You have a good foundation.

26:58.880 --> 27:00.310
Unfortunately, you didn't cultivate well

27:00.550 --> 27:01.250
and practiced martial arts

27:01.270 --> 27:02.790
just to rob and kidnap people.

27:04.070 --> 27:05.550
The Second Young Master of the Prince Zong's residence

27:05.720 --> 27:06.550
is with you, right?

27:07.070 --> 27:07.590
Give him to me.

27:08.790 --> 27:09.590
What Second Young Master?

27:10.200 --> 27:11.440
I don't understand what you're talking about.

27:12.590 --> 27:13.400
Su Yishui.

27:13.550 --> 27:14.750
Although your disguise technique

27:14.750 --> 27:15.640
is done well,

27:16.160 --> 27:16.830
since the last time

27:16.850 --> 27:18.010
I saw you,

27:18.360 --> 27:19.560
I have engrave

27:19.590 --> 27:20.620
your beautiful eyes

27:20.750 --> 27:21.960
deeply on my mind.

27:23.310 --> 27:24.240
You got the wrong person.

27:24.680 --> 27:25.640
My name is Su Cheng.

27:26.000 --> 27:26.890
I'm not the person you’re looking for.

27:28.000 --> 27:28.830
Su Cheng?

27:29.440 --> 27:29.920
Very well.

27:30.300 --> 27:31.210
Let me

27:31.240 --> 27:31.880
unveil your true face.

27:51.360 --> 27:51.990
You demoness.

27:52.310 --> 27:52.960
Let go of me!

27:53.400 --> 27:54.070
Why panic?

27:54.350 --> 27:55.600
Am I that scary?

27:57.750 --> 27:58.790
If you don't

27:58.820 --> 28:00.270
hand him over today,

28:02.580 --> 28:04.940
you can never escape me.

28:07.640 --> 28:08.400
Impressive.

28:09.230 --> 28:10.650
Even I can't break

28:10.680 --> 28:11.720
your disguise technique.

28:12.680 --> 28:13.680
Demoness...

28:26.350 --> 28:28.110
To escape, he'd rather injure himself.

28:32.310 --> 28:33.550
He was born with the Five Spirit Roots?

28:36.010 --> 28:37.160
Just like me.

28:37.790 --> 28:38.920
What a coincidence.

29:15.680 --> 29:16.640
He learns pretty fast.

29:28.310 --> 29:29.480
You came here yourself.

29:29.790 --> 29:30.830
This is not my fault.

29:40.660 --> 29:42.240
Where is the sedan chair?

29:43.270 --> 29:43.910
Go find it.

29:47.880 --> 29:49.070
What a handsome bride.

29:51.380 --> 29:52.900
You want to run away after getting on the bridal sedan?

29:53.880 --> 29:54.310
Tell me.

29:54.720 --> 29:55.240
Where is he?

29:58.750 --> 29:59.310
Guess.

30:00.920 --> 30:02.270
You still want to make a bet with me?

30:02.290 --> 30:02.880
Over there!

30:03.060 --> 30:03.870
The sedan chair is over there!

30:04.240 --> 30:04.590
Hurry!

30:06.550 --> 30:07.030
That's right.

30:07.290 --> 30:07.920
Let's bet

30:07.920 --> 30:08.790
if you can get this right.

30:09.450 --> 30:10.400
The number of people coming,

30:10.400 --> 30:11.000
is it an odd or even number?

30:11.680 --> 30:12.790
I'll tell you if you're right.

30:13.110 --> 30:14.680
I've never lost a bet.

30:15.350 --> 30:16.000
I'm guessing it's

30:16.350 --> 30:17.000
even.

30:20.880 --> 30:21.480
You lost.

30:21.530 --> 30:21.970
Wrong.

30:22.920 --> 30:23.550
It's a single number.

30:25.030 --> 30:25.880
Run! Run!

30:39.660 --> 30:40.590
Demonic energy?

30:49.610 --> 30:50.580
The Yin Eye Stone is lit.

30:54.550 --> 30:56.030
He's the Demon's child?

31:00.600 --> 31:03.330
[Mount Cuiwei]

31:08.350 --> 31:08.920
Go!

31:09.830 --> 31:10.640
Why did you stop?

31:11.770 --> 31:12.490
How about

31:13.110 --> 31:14.200
I help you?

31:23.360 --> 31:24.110
Qingge asked us

31:24.110 --> 31:25.240
to check someone’s information for her.

31:25.550 --> 31:26.110
I quit

31:27.070 --> 31:27.570
this game.

31:28.680 --> 31:29.550
Trying to play dirty again?

31:29.600 --> 31:30.560
Save this game for now.

31:30.590 --> 31:31.430
We'll play again next time.

31:31.520 --> 31:32.480
I finally beat you once.

31:32.510 --> 31:33.550
How could you do this?

31:37.680 --> 31:38.790
In that case,

31:39.750 --> 31:41.880
Su Yishui doing things for

31:42.440 --> 31:43.550
Prince Ping can be quite hostile,

31:44.220 --> 31:44.930
it's not that he's

31:44.960 --> 31:46.110
a villain.

31:47.480 --> 31:48.270
After all, Demon's child

31:48.290 --> 31:49.660
is just a form of nature.

31:50.550 --> 31:52.440
He has yet to bring disaster to the world.

31:53.030 --> 31:53.550
How can I

31:53.550 --> 31:54.440
judge him based on

31:54.440 --> 31:55.070
what could happen in the future?

31:56.960 --> 31:57.790
I have an idea.

31:58.160 --> 31:59.710
If I take him as my disciple

32:00.120 --> 32:01.510
and destroy his Demon's child nature,

32:01.990 --> 32:03.510
there's nothing to worry about.

32:04.550 --> 32:05.480
But if he really

32:05.480 --> 32:06.960
become a demon,

32:07.790 --> 32:08.920
I don't have to show mercy.

32:09.550 --> 32:10.680
I can only kill the demon.

32:11.650 --> 32:12.330
Everything

32:13.110 --> 32:14.270
will be determined by his heart.

32:22.070 --> 32:23.070
You just won't leave me alone.

32:23.480 --> 32:24.000
Kid.

32:24.550 --> 32:25.830
You were so harsh just now.

32:26.180 --> 32:27.040
Looks like Master Kaiyuan

32:27.070 --> 32:28.030
didn't teach you well.

32:28.370 --> 32:29.480
Let me teach you then.

32:32.840 --> 32:33.990
I'm now in the Transcendence Realm.

32:34.160 --> 32:35.270
You have a good foundation,

32:35.500 --> 32:36.640
but you've just reached the Foundation Building.

32:37.160 --> 32:37.750
You can't escape.

32:38.550 --> 32:39.830
I've killed him.

32:40.200 --> 32:41.270
It's useless for you to follow me.

32:41.550 --> 32:42.630
If you really wanted to kill him,

32:42.960 --> 32:44.510
why kidnap him first before killing?

32:44.830 --> 32:45.640
That's unnecessary.

32:48.270 --> 32:49.550
Looks like I was right.

32:50.400 --> 32:51.000
It doesn't matter.

32:51.480 --> 32:52.440
I will find him.

32:53.110 --> 32:54.410
I have a new idea.

32:55.000 --> 32:55.740
I haven't received

32:55.770 --> 32:57.330
a disciple as talented as you are.

32:57.880 --> 32:58.680
Recently,

32:58.700 --> 32:59.350
I've received a few

32:59.370 --> 33:00.720
good martial arts books.

33:01.240 --> 33:01.790
I need

33:01.790 --> 33:03.720
a talented disciple to practice together.

33:04.030 --> 33:04.750
I think

33:05.070 --> 33:05.950
you are suitable.

33:06.070 --> 33:07.000
I don't think so.

33:07.920 --> 33:08.950
We'll know if it's suitable

33:09.000 --> 33:10.160
after we try it.

33:10.680 --> 33:11.310
How about this?

33:11.790 --> 33:12.750
What do you like?

33:13.070 --> 33:14.310
No matter it's gold, silver, jade,

33:14.330 --> 33:15.260
or rare beasts,

33:15.400 --> 33:16.310
I'll get them for you.

33:16.750 --> 33:17.720
From now on, just follow me

33:17.960 --> 33:18.750
and be my disciple.

33:20.510 --> 33:21.830
I like you being away from me.

33:23.960 --> 33:25.200
This is a bit difficult.

33:28.550 --> 33:29.440
I think

33:29.700 --> 33:30.610
you look better

33:30.640 --> 33:31.440
with your original face.

33:32.590 --> 33:33.270
One more bet.

33:33.920 --> 33:34.720
If I can find out

33:34.750 --> 33:36.030
the flaw of your disguise technique,

33:36.640 --> 33:37.550
call me Master.

33:37.960 --> 33:38.830
-In your dreams.
-That's settled then.

33:43.960 --> 33:44.680
Su Cheng!

33:47.720 --> 33:48.270
Su Cheng!

33:48.750 --> 33:50.320
We were just going to the Eternal Sect for a lesson.

33:50.350 --> 33:51.510
But we saw you as we came down the mountain.

33:52.030 --> 33:52.590
Why are you

33:52.610 --> 33:53.690
near our Hollow Sect?

33:54.030 --> 33:55.070
I've been chased by

33:55.440 --> 33:56.480
a demoness all the way here.

33:58.550 --> 33:59.350
Mu Qingge?

34:00.720 --> 34:01.590
You know me?

34:02.510 --> 34:03.720
You look for pretty boys all over the world

34:03.740 --> 34:04.670
and is frivolous.

34:05.050 --> 34:06.240
You're infamous!

34:06.390 --> 34:07.750
Now you're clinging to the powerful

34:07.750 --> 34:08.800
and interfering with the worldly matters,

34:08.920 --> 34:10.360
you're despised by all Heavenly Sects.

34:10.840 --> 34:11.960
You pestering Su Cheng...

34:15.710 --> 34:16.630
Stay away from him!

34:18.630 --> 34:19.520
Since you already said

34:19.550 --> 34:20.960
I like pretty boys,

34:21.810 --> 34:23.320
how could I let go

34:23.550 --> 34:24.820
one that is as beautiful as he is?

34:25.190 --> 34:26.510
I'll take you as my disciple.

34:27.659 --> 34:29.179
This demoness is trying to bring me to Mount Wester against my will.

34:29.380 --> 34:30.170
I would rather die than obey,

34:30.360 --> 34:31.510
but I can't get rid of her.

34:35.480 --> 34:36.230
Shameless!

34:36.590 --> 34:37.230
Set up the formation!

34:42.860 --> 34:44.290
Calm down.

34:44.510 --> 34:45.710
We are all girls.

34:46.030 --> 34:47.590
It's ugly for us to fight.

34:47.840 --> 34:48.670
Cut the crap.

34:49.380 --> 34:51.320
[Eternal Sect]

34:57.840 --> 34:59.400
I finally got rid of that demoness.

35:16.030 --> 35:16.670
Su Cheng.

35:17.400 --> 35:18.920
You just got promoted to an internal disciple,

35:19.530 --> 35:21.050
yet you only return after a month.

35:21.920 --> 35:23.400
If you're so relaxed,

35:23.770 --> 35:25.520
how can you cultivate?

35:34.680 --> 35:36.040
Senior, you should worry about

35:36.070 --> 35:37.030
your own cultivation.

35:37.800 --> 35:38.590
-You…
-Su Cheng!

35:42.440 --> 35:43.480
Why did you leave

35:43.480 --> 35:44.110
without telling me?

35:44.270 --> 35:45.070
That demoness

35:45.070 --> 35:46.000
has been driven away by us.

35:46.440 --> 35:46.840
Thank you.

35:47.440 --> 35:48.880
I owe you a favor.

35:49.110 --> 35:49.840
I'll pay you back another day.

35:51.440 --> 35:52.320
You said that.

35:53.070 --> 35:53.630
Senior,

35:53.760 --> 35:54.470
haven't you been preparing a gift

35:54.490 --> 35:55.450
for Su Cheng for a

35:55.480 --> 35:56.480
long time?

35:57.920 --> 35:58.670
Give it to him.

36:00.190 --> 36:01.000
Su Cheng,

36:01.740 --> 36:03.510
I made this sword tassel myself.

36:03.840 --> 36:05.070
I hope you don't mind it.

36:09.760 --> 36:10.590
So Yan Liangyu

36:10.590 --> 36:12.030
is interested in Wen Hongshan.

36:13.970 --> 36:15.230
He is the direct disciple

36:15.250 --> 36:16.080
of Master Kaiyuan.

36:16.350 --> 36:17.540
He can be used by me.

36:22.190 --> 36:23.030
Thank you, Wen.

36:23.580 --> 36:24.230
He took it.

36:24.250 --> 36:25.000
He took it.

36:27.710 --> 36:28.360
What's wrong?

36:29.030 --> 36:30.150
That demoness hurt you?

36:30.320 --> 36:31.590
If it's just a small injury,

36:31.710 --> 36:32.920
you're being too delicate.

36:33.110 --> 36:34.590
You're not worthy of being a member of the Heavenly Sects.

36:37.110 --> 36:38.110
You're right.

36:38.930 --> 36:39.850
But whether I'm

36:39.880 --> 36:40.630
worthy or not

36:41.420 --> 36:42.740
is none of your business.

36:52.960 --> 36:54.760
Even if I'm not a disciple of the Heavenly Sects,

36:55.280 --> 36:56.960
Wen's heart is with me.

36:58.030 --> 36:59.280
It’s useless for you to even think about it.

37:03.630 --> 37:04.280
Su Cheng!

37:09.550 --> 37:10.400
Yan Liangyu!

37:10.960 --> 37:12.320
Su Cheng is injured.

37:12.870 --> 37:13.710
Yan Liangyu.

37:14.070 --> 37:15.670
As the direct disciple of the soverign,

37:15.920 --> 37:17.030
that's all you're capable of?

37:17.130 --> 37:18.260
That can't hurt me at all.

37:21.430 --> 37:22.680
What a loser.

37:32.190 --> 37:32.880
Su Cheng!

37:34.440 --> 37:35.030
Su Cheng!

37:35.700 --> 37:36.380
Su Cheng.

37:36.970 --> 37:38.250
Yan Liangyu, are you crazy?

37:38.420 --> 37:38.860
Slowly.

37:39.710 --> 37:40.190
Be careful.

37:41.880 --> 37:43.000
He's just stronger than me.

37:43.420 --> 37:44.340
It’s not his fault.

37:46.920 --> 37:47.480
Su Cheng.

37:49.280 --> 37:50.030
Su Cheng!

37:52.110 --> 37:52.880
Yan Liangyu.

37:53.070 --> 37:53.920
Why do you always have a

37:53.920 --> 37:54.670
bone to pick with Su Cheng?

37:55.150 --> 37:55.590
I...

37:57.800 --> 37:59.150
He's shrouded in evil aura.

37:59.800 --> 38:00.440
Wen,

38:00.800 --> 38:01.920
you'd better stay away from him

38:02.360 --> 38:03.760
before he corrects himself.

38:04.440 --> 38:05.280
I know what to do.

38:05.550 --> 38:06.230
It's none of your business.

38:09.070 --> 38:09.590
Senior.

38:09.920 --> 38:11.150
They flirt with each other,

38:11.720 --> 38:12.470
and are basically a couple.

38:12.960 --> 38:13.960
You stand no chance.

38:14.230 --> 38:14.920
That's right.

38:16.920 --> 38:17.920
You two want to get beaten up

38:17.920 --> 38:18.400
too?

38:30.780 --> 38:31.840
I finally forced Yan Liangyu

38:31.840 --> 38:33.400
to use Master Kaiyuan's technique.

38:33.970 --> 38:35.330
Now I can extract Master Kaiyuan's

38:35.360 --> 38:36.150
direct spiritual power

38:36.670 --> 38:37.590
to open the library.

38:43.230 --> 38:45.030
Obtain the Demon Heart Primordial Absorption Technique quickly.

38:45.630 --> 38:47.070
I have no patience left.

38:47.880 --> 38:49.670
You failed to kill

38:50.150 --> 38:51.190
Prince Zong's second son last time.

38:51.630 --> 38:52.550
I won't give you

38:52.570 --> 38:53.820
another chance.

38:54.070 --> 38:55.510
If you fail this time,

38:56.110 --> 38:57.760
you should know the consequences.

39:04.040 --> 39:05.590
[Eternal Sect]

39:06.160 --> 39:10.170
Eternal Sect's library]

39:42.550 --> 39:43.440
You're stealing something?

39:47.150 --> 39:48.070
Why are you here?

39:49.230 --> 39:50.630
The Eternal Sect's barrier

39:50.630 --> 39:51.550
is pretty difficult to break.

39:51.880 --> 39:53.190
But it's worth it if I can

39:53.400 --> 39:53.920
take you as my disciple.

39:54.380 --> 39:55.610
I said no way.

39:55.960 --> 39:57.510
That's why we're making a bet.

39:57.880 --> 39:59.110
You have a lot of secrets.

39:59.280 --> 40:00.360
You must be afraid of being found out.

40:01.070 --> 40:02.590
If you don't agree,

40:03.360 --> 40:04.800
I'll call someone over.

40:07.400 --> 40:08.030
Do you want to bet?

40:09.400 --> 40:09.840
Fine.

40:11.550 --> 40:12.440
That's right.

40:13.030 --> 40:14.240
I'll start looking for the breakthrough.

40:22.880 --> 40:25.630
Nose, chin, and neck.

40:26.630 --> 40:27.960
How pretty.

40:29.070 --> 40:30.950
Broad shoulders and a narrow waist.

40:31.920 --> 40:32.670
How beautiful.

40:35.150 --> 40:36.110
Are you looking for a weakness

40:36.110 --> 40:36.710
or flirt–

40:47.480 --> 40:48.190
I found it.

40:51.840 --> 40:52.750
How did you find it?

40:52.810 --> 40:53.810
You're determined.

40:54.230 --> 40:55.440
So you can breathe slowly

40:55.440 --> 40:56.280
and your heartbeat is stable.

40:56.510 --> 40:57.760
But this is where the weakness is at.

40:58.170 --> 40:59.050
No one with

40:59.080 --> 41:00.050
earlobes closer to each other

41:00.150 --> 41:01.000
can have more stable

41:01.000 --> 41:02.110
breath and heartbeat.

41:02.510 --> 41:04.030
It's obvious you're suppressing it.

41:04.470 --> 41:05.580
Naturally, it's the weakness.

41:06.440 --> 41:07.770
You have such a good face,

41:07.880 --> 41:09.000
why hide it?

41:09.590 --> 41:10.110
Let's go.

41:10.550 --> 41:11.510
Go to Mount Wester with me.

41:20.550 --> 41:21.590
Trying to cheat?

41:24.590 --> 41:26.070
I'll have to knock you out

41:26.190 --> 41:26.960
and drag you back.

41:31.510 --> 41:32.060
Do you still want to find

41:32.090 --> 41:33.380
Prince Zong's son?

41:40.230 --> 41:41.440
This is where he is.

41:42.110 --> 41:43.630
If you're late, he will be dead.

41:47.070 --> 41:48.280
At such a young age,

41:48.590 --> 41:49.510
you're pretty good at

41:49.510 --> 41:50.670
having people under your control.

41:54.510 --> 41:55.880
But after I save him,

41:56.070 --> 41:57.230
I will still come back to you.

41:57.800 --> 41:58.630
You can't escape.

42:10.120 --> 42:10.930
Where did you learn that?

42:10.960 --> 42:12.030
You're so cruel,

42:12.410 --> 42:13.810
wanting to kill so easily.

42:14.150 --> 42:15.440
You ruined my plan.

42:15.710 --> 42:17.110
A tree can't become a material if not trimmed.

42:17.480 --> 42:18.400
If I don't teach you a lesson,

42:20.380 --> 42:21.820
you'll only become worse.

42:23.110 --> 42:23.480
Hey!

42:29.130 --> 42:29.600
Oh no.

42:29.630 --> 42:30.550
Something's going on in the library!

42:41.280 --> 42:41.800
Take him down!
